{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17096","headline":"和武相公中秋锦楼翫月 一 · 崔备","name":"和武相公中秋锦楼翫月 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清景同千里，寒光尽一年。\n竟天多鴈过，通夕少人眠。\n照别江楼上，添愁野帐前。\n隋侯恩未报，犹有夜珠圆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔备","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17096.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17096","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}